  "description": "Won Il-Hoo is eager to return to university life after being discharged from the army. But when he meets the king of campus, Yoo Chae-Heon, things don’t go quite according to plan. Sometimes it seems like Chae-Heon is excited to get to know Il-Hoo, showering him with praise about his good looks and treating him to his favorite foods…but then he rags on him for being a pushover with too much time on his hands! As a tug of war between compliments and curses commences, Il-Hoo may just discover that he is more similar to Chae-Heon than he’d like to admit…and that might not be such a bad thing after all.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes four side story chapters.*",
